  "details": "Avatars in seats without any \"avatar\" set in the animator lag behind when the seat is moved in worlds.\n\navatar without \"avatar\" set in animator:\n\navtr_017879f6-dd90-42f3-90c5-f6390b2edbbe\n\navatar with \"avatar\" set in animator:\n\navtr_1129036e-0fa4-487b-bfaa-9f17397a1bf2\n\n1. create avatar without \"avatar\" set in animator\n\n2. sit in a seat in a world\n\n3. move the seat around and the avatar will lag behind it\n\nWorld you can use to test this where everyone is placed in seats:\n\nwrld_650084ad-f500-49da-b0a9-4ff498f7f23c",
